Bada bing, bada boom.

247
00:12:32,340 --> 00:12:36,660
Your big bad Oni tank's changing
into a chunk of Sword Hunter's armor,

248
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:40,000
raising his attack power
by a whopping 200 points.

249
00:12:41,140 --> 00:12:42,320
Oh, it's horrible.

250
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:43,960
Not bad.

251
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:46,217
Maybe Joey won't embarrass
himself after all.

252
00:12:46,300 --> 00:12:47,437
Think he's got a shot?

253
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:48,350
Yeah.

254
00:12:48,460 --> 00:12:53,057
Hey, puke Devlin, why don't you quit before
my sword guy messes up your pretty hair?

255
00:12:53,140 --> 00:12:56,020
I've got you just where
I want you. Ha-ha-ha!

256
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:58,360
You crack me up, pukey boy.

257
00:12:58,720 --> 00:13:00,367
But, hey, it's your funeral.

258
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:05,120
Ah, this will come in handy later.

259
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:08,760
I play Dark Bat in defensive mode.

260
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:12,160
And I lay another card face down as well.

261
00:13:14,540 --> 00:13:15,640
A bat?

262
00:13:15,900 --> 00:13:19,606
If that's the best you've got,
you're saying bye-bye card shop.

263
00:13:20,660 --> 00:13:23,560
Mad Sword Beast in attack
mode, coming at ya!

264
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:25,170
ATTACK!

265
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:38,365
No harm done, as the bat
was in defensive mode.

266
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:41,137
That's where you're wrong, Ponytail.

267
00:13:41,220 --> 00:13:43,357
The Mad Sword Beast
reduces your life points

268
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:46,146
even if your stinking
bat was in defense mode.

269
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:50,957
Perhaps I've underestimated you
But my dark bat won't be going

270
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:55,940
off to the graveyard all by himself
Thanks to Michizuri Michi what?

271
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:59,440
The Michizuri monster
will drag you to your doom

272
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,070
Ow,

273
00:14:04,153 --> 00:14:08,437
that hurt Joey better start thinking more
than one move ahead Don't get too cocky,

274
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:10,280
Joey Like I said before,

275
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:13,417
I got this match here
in a bag I could beat

276
00:14:13,500 --> 00:14:16,382
this two-bit loser even
in my sleep I don't know.

277
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:20,137
I think Duke Devlin knows more about
this game than he's letting on.

278
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:21,867
I hope Joey doesn't blow it.

279
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:24,777
Think that little trick's
gonna save you, bony butt?

280
00:14:24,860 --> 00:14:25,690
Think again.

281
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,497
I still got you where I want you.

282
00:14:27,580 --> 00:14:28,410
We'll see.

283
00:14:28,493 --> 00:14:31,377
Since your strongest monster
went off to an early grade,

284
00:14:31,460 --> 00:14:34,857
now would be an excellent time
for me to go on the attack.

285
00:14:34,940 --> 00:14:37,116
First, I'll play this card face down.

286
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:38,900
Yeah, yeah.

287
00:14:40,060 --> 00:14:41,940
Then I summon Spike Bot!

288
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:44,680
With Spike Attack!

289
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:50,000
Come on, Joey, concentrate!

290
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:52,417
Duke Devlin's just
trying to psych you out!

291
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:54,197
Don't let that Joker get to you!

292
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:56,697
If you lose, you're gonna have
to do whatever he tells you!

293
00:14:56,780 --> 00:14:58,074
Don't you forget that!

294
00:14:58,460 --> 00:14:59,500
Fat chance!

295
00:15:00,100 --> 00:15:02,720
Come on, Lady Luck, Joey needs a winner!

296
00:15:03,500 --> 00:15:04,330
Cha-ching!

297
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:07,700
This super card's gonna kick
your spiky bot's keyster!

298
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,070
Goblin!

299
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:11,180
Attack force! Bash him!

300
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:16,750
Yeah!

301
00:15:16,833 --> 00:15:20,127
You don't have a snowball's
chance in Hades now, Duke Deadman.

302
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:28,115
Ah, I forgot those goblin guys go
into defensive mode after they attack.

303
00:15:28,380 --> 00:15:29,640
No problemo.

304
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:31,898
He's only got 50 points left anyway.

305
00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:33,540
And next turn, it's zero.

306
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:36,939
And then you're gonna close
your shot down for good.

307
00:15:41,680 --> 00:15:45,800
Joey's really gonna win and make
your grandfather so happy. Go!

308
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:47,640
You got him now, Joey!

309
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:50,420
How can Duke Devlin still be so calm?

310
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:55,505
Either he's got ice in his blood, or he's
still got one last trick up his sleeve.

311
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:58,297
Just be careful! It's not over yet!

312
00:15:58,380 --> 00:16:01,145
Those girls are gonna be
cheering for Joey now.

313
00:16:01,260 --> 00:16:02,520
We love Joey!

314
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:05,417
Oh, I can't watch him.

315
00:16:05,500 --> 00:16:06,794
Enough fooling around.

316
00:16:07,020 --> 00:16:09,937
Time to summon one of the most
powerful cards in my deck.

317
00:16:10,020 --> 00:16:11,400
The Mighty Cards!

318
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:16,060
That all you got?

319
00:16:16,260 --> 00:16:17,907
Because that won't save you.

320
00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:23,940
And I use a magic card, Limiter
Removal, which doubles my attack power.

321
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:26,470
What?

322
00:16:26,553 --> 00:16:28,637
Holy cannoli, that's a lot of points.

323
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:32,920
Good thing I got all my goblins, or
he'd beat me with one lousy shot.

324
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:36,920
Wait, another magic
card, Fairy Meteor Crush.

325
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,480
Not that.

326
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:40,670
Hmm.

327
00:16:40,753 --> 00:16:42,177
Hey, I never heard of that fairy card.

328
00:16:42,260 --> 00:16:43,090
What's it do?

329
00:16:43,173 --> 00:16:47,197
Don't tell me the second-best duelist
doesn't know what this card does.

330
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:51,657
Well, you might say it's a magic card
version of the Mad Sword Beast card you play.

331
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:53,540
Mad Sword Beast. Hey!

332
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:54,817
That means...

333
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:56,780
This card has a special power.

334
00:16:57,220 --> 00:17:00,557
Usually, your monster in defensive
mode would absorb my attack.

335
00:17:00,640 --> 00:17:02,737
But with the Fairy Meteor Crush card,

336
00:17:02,820 --> 00:17:06,837
I can deal my damage directly
to your precious life points.

337
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:07,780
No!

338
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:16,000
It's a pity this match was so short.

339
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:19,757
I was hoping for an actual challenge,
but it was not meant to be.

340
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:22,537
The only thing that cheers
me up is knowing that

341
00:17:22,620 --> 00:17:25,800
you'll soon become my
servant for an entire week.

342
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:27,430
No!

343
00:17:28,300 --> 00:17:29,476
Cards, annihilate!

344
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:41,900
He wiped out all of Joey's goblins.

345
00:17:42,500 --> 00:17:44,420
And the rest of his life points.

346
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,920
It's the cool stablin' rules.

347
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:50,885
He's the master of all jewels.

348
00:17:51,460 --> 00:17:52,600
It's okay, Joey.

349
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:53,899
You did your best.

350
00:17:58,220 --> 00:17:59,220
Put it on.

351
00:17:59,860 --> 00:18:02,597
I hope that you're a man
of your word, Joey boy.

352
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:07,020
I'm looking forward to having an
obedient dog for the next week.

353
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:09,000
What happened to me?

354
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:12,597
When I was in the duelist kingdom,
I never made a mistake like this.

355
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:15,327
I had a purpose then,
fighting for my sister.

356
00:18:15,540 --> 00:18:17,834
Now I guess I've just gone to the dogs.

357
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:19,777
Hey, knock it off, Duke Devlin.

358
00:18:19,860 --> 00:18:22,237
Just because you won doesn't
mean you can put Joey down.

359
00:18:22,320 --> 00:18:24,060
Yugi, a promise is a promise.

360
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:27,848
And I gotta keep it even if it's
to a creep like that Devlin.

361
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:30,857
Are you okay?

362
00:18:30,940 --> 00:18:32,820
Shut your yap, you mongrel!

363
00:18:33,020 --> 00:18:36,138
You will not speak until
your master commands you to!

364
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:37,777
Come on, Joey, let's get out of here.

365
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:39,580
Sorry, guys, I gave my word.

366
00:18:42,280 --> 00:18:43,720
You're a dog now, Joey.

367
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:46,877
You don't say ouch, you say woof woof.

368
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,320
Yeah, woof woof.

369
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:51,440
Okay, now put it on and bark for me.

370
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:55,490
Bark, dog.

371
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:57,800
Watch him bark! Play the fool!

372
00:18:57,940 --> 00:18:59,540
Dog Boy Joey's not so cool!

373
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:04,180
The dog suit fits you perfectly, Joey.

374
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:06,088
Now give us your best bark.

375
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:08,360
Woof, woof.

376
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:13,280
Good boy, Joey. Enough, man. Get up.

377
00:19:13,820 --> 00:19:16,600
I have to put a stop to this. Yu-Gi-Oh!

378
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:24,300
Duke Devlin, your cruel stunt
has gone on long enough.

379
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:26,049
I challenge you to a duel.

380
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:32,060
And when I have defeated you, you will
declare Joey a free man again. Excellent.

381
00:19:32,540 --> 00:19:35,069
But we will play a game
of my own choosing.

382
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:39,520
We will battle to the finish in a
game called Dungeon Dice Monsters.

383
00:19:39,820 --> 00:19:44,120
And when you are the loser, you will
give the title King of Games to me.

384
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:49,066
And you will swear on your grandfather's
life never to play Duel Monsters again.

385
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:51,400
That is going too far.

386
00:19:51,580 --> 00:19:53,557
Yeah, Yugi, you've got too much to lose.

387
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:54,997
This is completely crazy.

388
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:56,660
Yugi, you can't do it.

389
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:58,940
Stop your gapping.

390
00:19:59,940 --> 00:20:01,780
So what's it gonna be, Yu-Gi?

391
00:20:02,420 --> 00:20:04,457
Duke, I will accept your conditions.

392
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:07,540
I will not let you destroy
the dignity of a friend.

393
00:20:07,820 --> 00:20:12,040
We will do battle in your game
of choice, Dungeon Dice Monsters.

394
00:20:12,540 --> 00:20:16,417
My friends are worth all the titles
and all the games in the world.

395
00:20:16,500 --> 00:20:18,397
I'll stick by them no matter what.

396
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:20,937
That's something Duke Devlin
will never understand.

397
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:22,314
I have to take him on.

398
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:23,640
For Joey's sake.

399
00:20:23,900 --> 00:20:26,037
You've fallen into my trap, Yu-Gi.

400
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:29,440
My Dungeon Dice Monsters will destroy you!

401
00:20:56,860 --> 00:20:58,260
You
